    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintergard is a first person point and click adventure game inspired by the classics. Explore Vintergard, a mysterious castle nestled in the remote mountain reaches of Scandinavia. Discover the secrets of the castle while solving puzzles. Unravel the mystery of why you were brought here. Uncover the motives of characters you meet and make critical choices that shape their fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles that weave into the narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sense of Danger:</strong> Making the wrong move can end your adventure prematurely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching narrative:</strong> Subtle choices will affect how the story plays out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Based on your choices, the ending will be different and will alter the fate of the characters you meet</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vintergard is a first person point and click adventure game inspired by the classics. Explore Vintergard, a mysterious castle nestled in the remote mountain reaches of Scandinavia. Discover the secrets of the castle while solving puzzles. Unravel the mystery of why you were brought here. Uncover the motives of characters you meet and make critical choices that shape their fates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First person exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles that weave into the narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sense of Danger:</strong> Making the wrong move can end your adventure prematurely</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Branching narrative:</strong> Subtle choices will affect how the story plays out</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> Based on your choices, the ending will be different and will alter the fate of the characters you meet</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Explore the mysterious castle Vintergard. Solve puzzles and unravel the mystery of why you were brought here. Make critical choices that will decide the fate of the castle inhabitants, in this first person point and click adventure inspired by the classics.",
